<h1>01 - Cookie authentication</h1>

<p>
    The simplest possible login: users live in memory (<code>UserService</code>).
    On login we create claims and store them in a cookie with <code>SignInAsync</code>.
</p>

<ul>
    <li><b>Secret</b> requires any logged-in user (<code>[Authorize]</code>) and shows how to read claims.</li>
    <li><b>Admin</b> requires the <code>IsAdmin</code> claim (<code>[Authorize(Policy = "AdminOnly")]</code>).</li>
</ul>
